+
+// Offset-per-tile (Mode 2) vertical entries for side-margin columns. The
+// hardware row has 32 entries for the native columns; a game that builds that
+// row from object state can publish the columns the margins need: v[i] is the
+// BG3-row entry (enable bits included) for map column first_col + i, counted
+// the way the native row is (column k spans screen x 8k+1..8k+8 at BG3
+// HOFS 0), negative and >= 32 allowed. Native columns keep the real row.
